Ah, of course.  The original poster had an uncursed luckstone.  When you 
have an uncursed luckstone your luck never changes with time.  So if you 
have bad luck, it will stay bad.  Get the luckstone blessed, and throw 
some gems at some co-aligned unicorns.

Although, even if your luck was bad, you should have some chance of finding
a door.  With luck=-10, it should be something like 1/420 (and I just
assumed that rnl() was just another standard random function, not a 
special nethack one).
